# Only what the api, parser and steam worker run, so a web-only change keeps this image cached
# (and its containers running). Replaces the root .dockerignore for this build. Workspace
# package.json files stay: bun's frozen install checks every workspace against bun.lock.
**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/dist
.git
.env
.env.*
*.dem
*.dem.bz2
**/*.md
**/test
**/*.test.ts
docs
infra
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
apps/recorder/*
!apps/recorder/package.json
packages/oxlint-plugin-subtick/*
!packages/oxlint-plugin-subtick/package.json
